      "id": "file:src/main.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "src/main.js",
      "filePath": "src/main.js",
      "summary": "Vue 应用入口：createApp 挂载 App.vue、全局引入 style.css，并注册 v-rise 指令——用 IntersectionObserver 在元素进入视口时添加 .in 类实现淡入上浮（仅 transform/opacity）。",
      "tags": ["entry", "vue", "bootstrap", "animation"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "Vue 3 createApp + app.directive 自定义指令；全局单例 IntersectionObserver，命中后 unobserve 避免重复触发。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/App.vue",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "src/App.vue",
      "filePath": "src/App.vue",
      "summary": "根组件：认证门（未登录渲染 LoginView）、顶部导航分段切换三个视图、KeepAlive 缓存、每 5 秒轮询 /api/state，并通过 Toast 反馈操作结果；监听自定义事件 gpuc:unauthorized 处理会话失效。",
      "tags": ["ui", "auth", "layout", "polling", "toast"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Vue 3 <script setup> + KeepAlive；无 Router，视图切换用 currentView ref 手写。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/api.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "src/api.js",
      "filePath": "src/api.js",
      "summary": "前端共享层：api() 统一封装 fetch（POST JSON / GET），遇到 401 派发 window 事件 gpuc:unauthorized 并抛错；另提供 HTML 转义 esc、字节/显存格式化 fmtB/fmtMB、相对时间 ago、随机密码生成 genPassword。",
      "tags": ["http-client", "utils", "formatting", "auth-signal"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/style.css",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "src/style.css",
      "filePath": "src/style.css",
      "summary": "全局设计系统（Ethereal Glass / Double-Bezel）：CSS 变量定义配色、玻璃拟态与双层描边 .bezel/.core、按钮/输入/表格/模态/Toast/登录页，以及 v-rise 入场动画关键帧。",
      "tags": ["design-system", "css", "theming", "glassmorphism"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/views/DashboardView.vue",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "src/views/DashboardView.vue",
      "filePath": "src/views/DashboardView.vue",
      "summary": "集群总览页：四张统计卡（在线机器 / GPU 平均利用率 / 显存占用 / 活跃用户），每台机器一张卡片（GPU 利用率与显存条、温度功耗、CPU/内存/磁盘三条、趋势 Sparkline），可展开查看 GPU 进程明细与登录用户，底部全集群占卡进程表（按显存排序）。",
      "tags": ["view", "monitoring", "dashboard", "gpu"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/views/UsersView.vue",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "src/views/UsersView.vue",
      "filePath": "src/views/UsersView.vue",
      "summary": "用户管理页：新建账号表单（用户名校验、生成初始密码、可选 sudo、勾选目标机器或全选），下方「机器 × 用户矩阵」每台机器一张卡列出本地账号，悬停出现改密/删除，删除与改密各有确认模态框。",
      "tags": ["view", "account-management", "crud", "matrix"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/views/LoginView.vue",
